  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"x plus y equals 18\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>18</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"5 y equals x\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">What is the solution&nbsp;<math alttext=\"left parenthesis x comma y right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> to the given system of equations?</p>",
